passage:{en:'Our school has a small corner for objects donated by local families. After a survey, we decided to restore its old wooden display case. We could clean the shelves ourselves, but the cracked glass needed a professional. We had the glass replaced and are having a safer lock fitted this week. Meanwhile, a photography enthusiast helped us scan the labels so that we could preserve their stories online. One label explained who had built the case. It made us realise that repairing an ordinary object can also protect part of a community’s memory.',zh:'学校有一个小角落，用来陈列本地家庭捐赠的物品。调查之后，我们决定修复那里的旧木展柜。架子我们可以自己清理，但裂了的玻璃需要专业人员处理。我们请人换了玻璃，这周正请人安装一把更安全的锁。与此同时，一位摄影爱好者帮我们扫描标签，以便在线保存其中的故事。有一张标签介绍了是谁制作了这个柜子。它让我们意识到，修好一件普通物品，也能保护一部分社区记忆。'},
