sourceLesson:68,title:'安静区的共同约定',scene:'图书馆小组学习',goal:'用动名词讨论习惯、意见与正在发生的活动。',
grammar:g('动名词与感官动词后的 -ing','avoid、enjoy、mind 等动词后常接动名词，insist on 中的 on 后也用 -ing。较正式的表达可用物主形式加动名词，如 my arriving late。see/hear 加宾语加 -ing，强调看到或听到正在进行的活动。go/come 加 -ing 可表示游泳、购物等活动。','Would you mind my moving this chair?','你介意我挪动这把椅子吗？','I heard someone practising the violin upstairs.','我听见有人正在楼上练小提琴。'),
vocabulary:[v('persistent','坚持不懈的；持续存在的','Her persistent efforts finally brought more students to the reading club.','她坚持不懈的努力终于吸引了更多学生加入阅读社。'),v('avoid','避免；避开','We avoid making calls in the quiet study area.','我们避免在安静学习区打电话。'),v('insist','坚持要求；坚持说，常用 insist on','The team insisted on checking the data again.','小组坚持再检查一遍数据。')],
passage:{en:'Our study group used to meet beside the library entrance, where we often heard people talking. We tried ignoring the noise, but nobody could concentrate for long. A persistent member suggested booking a quieter room. The librarian agreed, provided that we avoided eating there and finished before closing time. She did not mind our moving the chairs if we put them back afterwards. We now take turns checking the room before leaving. Some of us go swimming afterwards, but nobody insists on everyone joining. A useful group routine should make studying easier without controlling every part of our day.',zh:'我们的学习小组过去常在图书馆入口旁集合，那里经常能听到人们说话。我们试过忽略噪声，但谁都无法长时间集中注意力。一位坚持不懈的成员建议预约一间更安静的房间。图书管理员同意了，条件是我们不在里面吃东西，并且在闭馆前结束。只要之后把椅子放回去，她不介意我们移动椅子。现在，我们轮流在离开前检查房间。有些人之后去游泳，但没人坚持要求所有人都参加。好的小组习惯应当让学习更轻松，而不是控制一天中的每个部分。'},
questions:[
c('语法：Please avoid ___ the same file twice.',['uploading','to upload','upload'],'uploading','avoid 后接动名词。'),
c('语法：强调我经过时听到正在发生的活动。I heard the choir ___ as I passed.',['singing','to sing','sang'],'singing','hear 加宾语加 -ing，描述听见某人正在做某事。'),
c('词汇：一次失败后仍然不断尝试，可以说这个人是 ___.',['persistent','absent','careless'],'persistent','persistent 强调坚持努力、不轻易放弃。'),
c('阅读：图书管理员允许挪动椅子的条件是什么？',['The students must put them back afterwards.','Everyone must go swimming after studying.','The room must stay open all night.'],'The students must put them back afterwards.','文中 if we put them back afterwards 明确给出了条件。'),
t('控制写作：用 insist on 和 check 的正确形式补全，只填缺少部分：Our editor will ___ every name.',['insist on checking'],'介词 on 后用动名词 checking。'),
o('排序：组成礼貌询问是否介意的句子。','Would you mind my opening the window?','mind 后用 my opening；这里 my 标明执行动作的人。')],sourcePages:[311,312,313]
